# SvelteKit
.svelte-kit/
web/build/
# Everything under web/static/data/ (including maintainer-history.json and
# feedstock-count-history.json) is written by `fsm generate site-data` at deploy time only
# (see .github/workflows/pages.yml) -- already fully covered by the `data/` rule above, so
# nothing here is ever committed to git. Those two history files themselves are appended to by
# `update.yml` and persisted across runs via the recipe-cache artifact (like every other root
# *.json artifact), not via git.
